        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅰ問　解と係数をa,bの図へつなぐ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア 2／イ 5／ウ 5／エ 5"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "オ 8／カ 4／キク −4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "ケコ 16／サ 8／シ 4／ス 3／セソ −5"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最初に、2次方程式の解と係数の関係を固定します。以後の式をすべてa,bで表す土台です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha+\\beta=-a,\\qquad \\alpha\\beta=4b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "さらに条件式は、中心(5,0)、半径5の円を表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a^2-10a+b^2=0\\iff(a-5)^2+b^2=25",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 非実数解では絶対値の平方を見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "実係数2次方程式の非実数解は共役です。したがって|α|²はαβに置き換えられます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=a^2-16b<0,\\qquad |\\alpha|^2=\\alpha\\overline{\\alpha}=\\alpha\\beta=4b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "円周上でD<0となる弧では0<b≤5です。b=5のときが最大です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|\\alpha|_{\\max}=\\sqrt{4\\cdot5}=2\\sqrt5,\\qquad(a,b)=(5,5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-region-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 重解なら判別式を0にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=0\\iff b=\\frac{a^2}{16}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この式を円の条件へ代入し、a≠0を使って因数分解します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(a-8)(a^2+8a+320)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2次因子は(a+4)²+304で0になりません。よってa=8です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a=8,\\qquad b=4,\\qquad \\alpha=\\beta=-\\frac a2=-4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tohoku-medical-pharmaceutical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 実数解の条件で使える円弧を確定する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "D=a^2-16b\\ge0\\iff b\\le\\frac{a^2}{16}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "円周と放物線を重ねると、使える円弧では−5≤b≤4です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-region-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3-1) 対称式をbだけの式にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+10\\alpha+10\\beta=a^2-10a-8b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "条件式からa²−10a=−b²なので、平方完成できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-b^2-8b=-(b+4)^2+16",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "−5≤b≤4にb=−4が含まれるため、最大値は16です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3-2) 直線を円弧に当てる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\alpha\\beta-\\alpha-\\beta=a+\\sqrt3b=m",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "mを固定すると傾き−1/√3の直線です。平行移動して円弧に最後に触れる位置を調べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b=-\\frac1{\\sqrt3}a+\\frac m{\\sqrt3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最大は円弧の端点(a,b)=(8,4)で取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m_{\\max}=8+4\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最小側は円に接します。中心(5,0)と直線a+√3b−m=0の距離を5と置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{|5-m|}{2}=5\\iff|5-m|=10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "下側の接線なのでm<0を選び、最小値は−5です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-line-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第Ⅰ問の確認",
            "text": "判別式で使える円弧を決めてから、式をa,bへ変換します。最大最小では端点と接点の両方を確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tohoku-medical-pharmaceutical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅱ問　道順を移動文字の並べ替えにする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "アイウ 126"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "エオ 60"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "カキ 90"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "クケコ 245／サシスセ 1524"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "東へ1区画をE、北へ1区画をNと表します。最短経路はEとNの並べ替えです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 全最短経路",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{9!}{5!4!}={}_9\\mathrm C_4=126",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) Qで前後に分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_4\\mathrm C_2\\times{}_5\\mathrm C_2=6\\times10=60",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 通る道順を引く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "QRを通る、RSを通る、両方を通る、の三つを数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N(QR)=24",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N(RS)=30",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "N(QR\\cap RS)=18",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "両方を通る経路は二度引かれるため、一度戻します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "126-(24+30-18)=90",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-venn",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4-1) 西へ戻る地点を三場合に分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A\\to P\\to P'\\to B:\\quad{}_3\\mathrm C_1\\times{}_7\\mathrm C_3=105",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tohoku-medical-pharmaceutical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A\\to Q\\to Q'\\to B:\\quad{}_4\\mathrm C_2\\times{}_6\\mathrm C_2=90",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A\\to R\\to R'\\to B:\\quad{}_5\\mathrm C_2\\times{}_5\\mathrm C_1=50",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "105+90+50=245",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4-2) Wを含む文字列を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "西へ1区画をWとします。6個のEの間にWを入れられる位置は5か所です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "できた7文字の塊と4個のNを並べ替えるので、いったん5×₁₁C₄通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "5\\times{}_{11}\\mathrm C_4=1650",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "ただし最後がWEの経路は、Bへ到達後に西へ戻って再到達します。これは元の最短経路126通りだけあります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1650-{}_9\\mathrm C_4=1650-126=1524",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "第Ⅱ問の確認",
            "text": "指定点は前後の積、禁止辺は包除原理、西向き1回は文字列化、と条件ごとに数え方を切り替えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第Ⅲ問　tan x=tで導関数を因数分解する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア 3／イ 3／ウ 0"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "エ 1／オ 3／カ 9／キ 3／ク 3／ケ 2／コ 8／サ 1／シ 4／ス 7／セ 3／ソ 2／タ 4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "チ 1／ツテ 12／トナ 13／ニ 7／ヌ 3／ネ 2／ノ 8／ハ 6／ヒ 2"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) まずf'を一つの式にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=(1+\\sqrt3)\\tan x(1+\\tan^2x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "+(3-\\sqrt3)(1+\\tan^2x)-8\\tan x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(0)=3-\\sqrt3,\\qquad f'(\\pi/4)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tohoku-medical-pharmaceutical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) f'=0の三つの解を出す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "tan x=tと置きます。(1)からt=1が解と分かるので、3次式を(t−1)で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(t-1)(t+\\sqrt3)(1+\\sqrt3)\\{t-(2-\\sqrt3)\\}=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=-\\sqrt3,\\quad 2-\\sqrt3,\\quad1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "定義域で対応するxを求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=-\\frac\\pi3,\\qquad \\frac\\pi{12},\\qquad \\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "tan xは単調増加するので、因数の符号からf'の符号を決めます。−π/3とπ/4が極小、π/12が極大です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "f(x)の増減",
            "rows": [
              [
                "\\(x\\)",
                "\\(-\\pi/2\\)",
                "\\(-\\pi/3\\)",
                "\\(\\pi/12\\)",
                "\\(\\pi/4\\)",
                "\\(\\pi/2\\)"
              ],
              [
                "\\(f'(x)\\)",
                "−",
                "0",
                "0",
                "0",
                "+"
              ],
              [
                "\\(f(x)\\)",
                "↘",
                "極小 ↗",
                "極大 ↘",
                "極小 ↗",
                ""
              ]
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次にgを求めます。定義域ではcos x>0ですが、原本どおり絶対値を経由します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "g(x)=\\int\\tan x\\,dx=-\\log|\\cos x|+C",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "g(0)=0からC=0です。したがってfでは−8g(x)=8log|cos x|となります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "g(x)=-\\log|\\cos x|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tohoku-medical-pharmaceutical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "二つの極小値を代入で求める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(-\\pi/3)=\\frac{9-3\\sqrt3}{2}-8\\log2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(\\pi/4)=\\frac{7-\\sqrt3}{2}-4\\log2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 極大値はx=π/12で取る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "tan(π/12)=2−√3を代入します。対数部分のcos(π/12)は加法定理で計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos\\frac\\pi{12}=\\cos(\\pi/4-\\pi/6)=\\frac{\\sqrt6+\\sqrt2}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(\\pi/12)=\\frac{13-7\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "+8\\log\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6+\\sqrt2}{4}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "70分の使い方",
            "text": "第Ⅱ問(1)(2)、第Ⅰ問(2)(3-1)、第Ⅲ問(1)を先に確保します。次に第Ⅰ問(1)(3-2)と第Ⅱ問(3)(4-1)を進め、第Ⅱ問(4-2)と第Ⅲ問(2)(3)は残り時間で扱います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "人間確認待ち",
            "text": "この解説は原本の解法順と答えを維持した編集案です。科目担当者による数式・答案表現・戦略の最終確認が必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
